Overall this function is clear and well‐structured, but I have a few suggestions to make it more robust and maintainable:

1. Wrap related DB operations in a transaction
   • You’re performing multiple Prisma calls (checking for an existing slug, creating the fine‑tune record, copying pruning rules, etc.). Wrapping them in a single transaction ensures that if any step fails, all prior changes roll back.
